<metadata><name>Galičica trail G-3</name><desc>G-3 is one of Galičica National Park's high ridge trails above 1,600 m. It runs 0.8 km from the H-5 junction to near Shipokno, climbing about 22 m and descending 0 m in the direction drawn, between 1,178 m and 1,209 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/g-3/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
